{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-89466-r4524032","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Holiday Cake (Spiced Fruitcake Loaf)","sourcePageId":89466,"sourceRevision":"4524032","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-07-15T19:59:48Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Holiday%20Cake%20(Spiced%20Fruitcake%20Loaf)&oldid=4524032","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:05:20.515Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Christmas recipes","Category:Holiday recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for cake","Category:Recipes using allspice","Category:Recipes using baking powder","Category:Recipes using brown sugar","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using cherry","Category:Recipes using cherry juice","Category:Recipes using clove","Category:Recipes using cpw milk","Category:Recipes using date","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using maraschino cherry","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"e8af9b9a96e609c0d30222d7774c217dca092c4f4a40371b6cb1c3e93f763c34","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Cake recipes\n| Yield = 3 loaves\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:United States|United States]] | [[Cookbook:Cake|Cake]]\n\nThe original recipe contributor submitted the following information:<blockquote>\"This is from an old recipe book of my mother's. There's a little note on the page: 'fruitcake—only better'. It's tricky to get right but it's well worth the time and effort. We usually make it around Christmastime.\"</blockquote>\n\n== Ingredients ==\n__NOTOC__\n*1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (240 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]]) pitted [[Cookbook:Date|dates]]\n*2 cups (480 ml) [[Cookbook:Maraschino Cherry|maraschino cherries]]\n*½ cup (120 ml) [[Cookbook:Cherry|cherry]] [[Cookbook:Juice|juice]]\n*1 cup (240 ml) [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n*3 cups (720 ml) [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n*5 large [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]], separated\n*1 cup (240 ml) [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Vanilla|vanilla]]\n*3 ½ cups (830 ml) [[Cookbook:Sifting|sifted]] [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n*4 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n*½ tsp [[Cookbook:Clove|cloves]]\n*½ tsp [[Cookbook:Allspice|allspice]]\n*½ tsp [[Cookbook:Nutmeg|nutmeg]]\n*1 tsp [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n*1 tsp [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*2 ½ cups (600 ml) [[Cookbook:Nuts and seeds|chopped nuts]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n=== Day 1 ===\n# Cut dates and cherries into small pieces and soak them in cherry juice overnight.\n\n=== Day 2 ===\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 250°F (120˚C).\n# [[Cookbook:Creaming|Cream]] butter, add half of the sugar. [[Cookbook:Beating|Beat]] until fluffy.\n# In another bowl beat egg yolks until thick. Add remaining sugar.\n# Combine the two mixtures and beat together.\n# Sift together flour, salt, baking powder, and spices.\n# Add dry ingredients and milk alternately to wet mixture, beating well after each addition.\n# [[Cookbook:Folding|Fold]] in stiffly-beaten egg whites.\n# Add in fruit and nuts [[Cookbook:Dredging|dredged]] lightly with flour.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] in lined loaf pans in [[Cookbook:Oven Temperatures|slow oven]] for 3 hours.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using cherry]]\n[[Category:Recipes using date]]\n[[Category:Christmas recipes]]\n[[Category:Holiday recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for cake]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using allspice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using clove]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cherry juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using maraschino cherry]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cpw milk]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Holiday Cake (Spiced Fruitcake Loaf)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 cup (240 ml) pitted dates","sourceText":"1 cup (240 ml) pitted dates","amountText":"1 cup (240 ml) pitted dates","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 cups (480 ml) maraschino cherries","sourceText":"2 cups (480 ml) maraschino cherries","amountText":"2 cups (480 ml) maraschino cherries","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"½ cup (120 ml) cherry juice","sourceText":"½ cup (120 ml) cherry juice","amountText":"½ cup (120 ml) cherry juice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 cup (240 ml) butter","sourceText":"1 cup (240 ml) butter","amountText":"1 cup (240 ml) butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"3 cups (720 ml) brown sugar","sourceText":"3 cups (720 ml) brown sugar","amountText":"3 cups (720 ml) brown sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"5 large egg